<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cen bank sets 2-week reverse repo at 16.2pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cen bank sets 2-week reverse repo at 16.2pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Monday it would drain liquidity from the local money market through a two-week reverse repo tender, with maximum yield set at 16.2 percent.</p>
<p>The limit rate was unchanged from the previous CNB tender.</p>
<p>The CNB said it would accept two bids from each party totalling at least 100 million crowns before the deadline at 9:50 a.m. (0750 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
